title: "DataForSEO Brain: a source-cited operating memory for the DataForSEO v3 API"
abstract: >-
  An Obsidian knowledge brain covering the 12 modules and ~200+ endpoints of the DataForSEO v3 API:
  the task/live execution model, the per-call cost model, capability notes per module, practitioner
  workflows, and decision guides. Built from official documentation and live API verification.
